      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with the Google Cloud Translation API for this project. It is easy to use and well-documented. I need to make sure the provider is explicitly defined within the Python code, so I can ensure it's easily modifiable, should I need to swap providers in the future.\n\n\n**Implementing the Core Logic**\n\nI'm now diving into the implementation. I've chosen the Google Cloud Translation API and am structuring the `batch_translate.py` file. The function will take a list of strings, along with the source and target languages. I am working on the function that calls the API, and keeping track of translated strings. I'm taking care to preserve the original order.\n\n\n",
