    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API for the Python script. My immediate task is to identify and integrate it clearly within the `translate_text.py` file. I'm focusing on making this integration robust and easy to understand.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Logic**\n\nI've got the `translate_text.py` file created. Now I'm focused on implementing the translation logic with the Google Cloud Translation API. I'm importing the necessary client library, and I'll initialize the client next. Then I'll define a function to handle text, source, and target languages, using the `translate_text` method. Finally, I'll return the translated text.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820102372,
          "start": 1789820100614
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9976006001o4Xvfh9PQ3zAxJ",
      "message_id": "msg_0b997591b001Zfl5ITubCqnABf",
